WEBVTT

00:00:57.646 --> 00:01:02.290
I was born in a trailer on the third
anniversary of Roe vs. Wade.

00:01:03.578 --> 00:01:06.265
Our community was surfing Christians.

00:01:06.265 --> 00:01:09.650
We cared about God, the less fortunate,
and the ocean.

00:01:10.022 --> 00:01:11.740
Everyone was pro-life.

00:01:12.413 --> 00:01:18.125
As a kid, the idea of abortion made me so
sad that I knew if I ever got pregnant

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:19.522
I could never have one.

00:01:21.412 --> 00:01:22.560
And then I did.

00:01:24.789 --> 00:01:26.809
It was a step towards the unknown.

00:01:27.531 --> 00:01:30.305
But Polly had given me
a very special gift: